  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Spark - Netherlands &apos;Community of practice&apos; promotion of clean cooking for everybody</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch Spark is a unique collaboration between Netherlands-based public, business, finance, carbon, and development partners to accelerate the transition to clean cooking.Founded in 2015 as a Community of Practice, Dutch Spark has since made a constructive contribution to highlighting Dutch knowledge and expertise regarding clean and efficient cooking, and has developed into an important network for knowledge exchange.</narrative>
  </description>
